  "description": "A lightweight library that integrates MediatR with FluentValidation and ASP.NET Core Authorization to enable clean, vertical \"slicing\" of application features. Features automatic resource resolution, authentication-only interfaces, and streamlined controller patterns.",
  "frameworkReferences": "",
  "id": "SliceR",
